**Friction encountered & handled (3 pipeline landmines, none in app code):**
1. Onboard-written profile embedded `./gradlew <task>` in `verify` keys, but the harness passes values as bare task names → first verify died before compiling. Fixed the project profile (`:app:compileDebugKotlin` / `:app:testDebugUnitTest`).
2. `build_prompt` reads `profile["components_dir"]` but onboard writes `shared_components_dir` → KeyError. Added the alias key to the project profile.
