**Durable fixes suggested (logged to `dev-team/skills/lessons.md`, 3 entries):** onboard should emit bare task names or `gradle_task` should strip the wrapper; alias `components_dir` in onboard/profile contract; `shipper.profile_of` should fall back to the parent project's `.pipeline` so worktrees don't need manual profile copies. A profile-shape validation check-script would have pre-caught all three.

